WEBVTT

00:00:58.763 --> 00:01:00.515
just to get on the stage.

00:01:02.725 --> 00:01:03.893
It was the idea

00:01:03.893 --> 00:01:07.063
that the cross-border movement of people
shouldn't be so difficult

00:01:07.063 --> 00:01:10.775
that sparked my inspiration
for a future of frictionless,

00:01:10.775 --> 00:01:12.527
borderless mobility for all,

00:01:12.568 --> 00:01:14.237
regardless where they are born.

00:01:14.821 --> 00:01:18.282
We are building a universal
digital identity

00:01:18.282 --> 00:01:20.034
for cross-border movement.

00:01:20.409 --> 00:01:22.203
One where people own their data

00:01:22.245 --> 00:01:25.456
and can seamlessly relocate
anywhere they want

00:01:25.498 --> 00:01:27.166
with minimal friction.

00:01:27.750 --> 00:01:30.753
One which would eventually
allow individuals,